<title>FINLAND: MERITA SAYS UPS STAKE IN LASSILA&amp;TIKANOJA.</title>
<headline>MERITA SAYS UPS STAKE IN LASSILA&amp;TIKANOJA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish banking group Merita said on Tuesday it had raised its stake in Finnish plastic and cleaning equipment maker Lassila &amp; Tikanoja Oy to 10.12 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;The increase in ownership is due to the decison made by the board of Lassila &amp; Tikanoja to cancel 465,120 shares held by the company,&quot; Lassila said in a statement.</p>
<p>Lassila announced the cancellation last week.</p>
<p>It said the shares were cancelled to clarify the ownership structure.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
